  "question": {
    "text": "$(\\Delta \\mathrm{H}-\\Delta \\mathrm{U})$ for the formation of carbon monoxide (CO) from its elements at $298 \\mathrm{~K}$ is $\\left(\\mathrm{R}=8.314 \\mathrm{~J} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right)$",
